sigBlockFn =
  rtFunc
    "sig_block"
    0
    [IBinReg "xor" Rdi (OpReg Rdi), ILea Rsi sigalrmSetLabel, IBinReg "xor" Rdx (OpReg Rdx), IMov (OpReg R10) (OpImm 8), IMov (OpReg Rax) (OpImm (sysNr "rt_sigprocmask")), ISyscall, IRet]

-- | `rt_sigprocmask(SIG_UNBLOCK, rt_sigalrm_set, NULL, 8)`：确实成了组首之后再放行 SIGALRM。
